# Vantablack Protocol Phase 2: The Librarian's Shutter

## Goal
Transform the [enrichmentService.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/enrichmentService.ts) into a **Cognitive Firewall** that enforces exposure mode rules across all AI interactions.

---

## Proposed Changes

### [NEW] `VantablackShutter` Module
#### [NEW] [vantablackShutter.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/vantablackShutter.ts)

Central privacy enforcement module with three core functions:

1. **`getRedactedNames(tags)`** — Returns Set of blacklisted entity names (exposure_mode === 'black')
2. **`filterGreyTags(tags, userPrompt)`** — Returns only grey tags explicitly mentioned in current turn
3. **`redactText(text, blacklistedNames)`** — Find/replace sacred names with `[REDACTED_ENTITY]`
4. **`auditResponse(responseText, blacklistedNames)`** — Post-generation safety check

