### Chat Context Pipeline

#### [MODIFY] [context.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/ai/context.ts)

**`buildMatrixContext(media)`** → Add tag filtering:
- Exclude BLACK tags entirely from context
- Include GREY tags only if mentioned in user prompt (passed as param)

#### [MODIFY] [chat.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/ai/generators/chat.ts)

**[generateAgentResponse()](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/ai/generators/chat.ts#13-316)**:
